{"author":[{"collection_id":"Authors","document_content":{"avatar":{"file_path":"_f68a99ffe9144467a917320028f1ce3b_/_50ac3cbb26fa4c21a9967e26675f94c5_/8414acf452522737f48c08c8c5976af07fdb8703d86bb5e3fca677e0fcf4be0a5faeafc32b6bc9c0e3ad275299b446d916915a953891b1da7e7c650ae26c47cc","height":4500,"url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/4CeuwweOMM2Nk21IwJVch_DRyVNG2GJFy7xmYu69Z4c33N_cZ4Zaroj75RadsCJyQWNLw3-eMJvjm9s1XLqEvndv83HREanS8otMPWf1kLXiLKUsTT_A","width":3000},"name":"Elliot Jay Stocks","title":"Guest author of Google Fonts"},"document_id":5316982962126848,"document_label":null,"repo_id":"mio-example"}],"body_content":[{"code_snippet":[],"content":"<p>今天，我们正式发布 <a href=\"http://fonts.google.com/knowledge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google Fonts Knowledge</a>：一个内容丰富的字体排印世界指南库，由来自全球各地的字体排印专家撰写。作为 Google Fonts 目录的补充，它涵盖适用于任何媒介的字体排印通用原则，让各种技能水平的设计师和开发者都能有目的地选择和使用字体。</p>\n<p>如果手握上好的食材却不知道如何烹调，也可能毁掉一顿美餐。同样，好的字体也可能被用得很糟糕&mdash;当然，不太理想的字体同样可以成就出色的设计。</p>\n<p>在许多场景下，设计应用甚至文字处理应用中的默认设置已经可以让我们走得很远，但懂得如何自定义这些设置，能让我们为读者把工作做得好得多。深思熟虑的字体选择和字体排印决策是对内容的尊重，无论内容是一整本书、作品集网站、电商应用、简历、年报，还是仅仅一个单词的标志。出色的字体排印可以在品牌工作中强化文本的含义，在导视中辅助用户的意图，并让我们的读者获得更好的阅读体验。</p>\n<p>反过来说，敷衍或笨拙的字体排印会毁掉读者的阅读体验，也很容易让他们与内容脱节。如果不肯花时间考虑信息呈现给读者的方式，我们就有可能传递错误的信息，或者让人觉得我们根本不在乎这条信息。</p>\n<p>Google Fonts Knowledge 目前的内容库由分布在三个模块中的 30 多节课组成&mdash;<a href=\"http://fonts.google.com/knowledge/introducing_type\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">字体入门</a>、<a href=\"http://fonts.google.com/knowledge/choosing_type\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">字体的选择</a>和<a href=\"http://fonts.google.com/knowledge/using_type\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">字体的使用</a>&mdash;此外还有 100 多条<a href=\"http://fonts.google.com/knowledge/glossary\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">术语表释义</a>。这些内容将随着新课、新释义乃至全新模块的推出而不断演进，发布内容也会根据你的反馈进行更新&mdash;因此欢迎随时<a href=\"https://twitter.com/googlefonts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">告诉我们你的想法</a>。无论是正面还是负面、具体还是宽泛，我们都想知道你希望在 Google Fonts Knowledge 上看到哪些内容，以便把它打造成有价值的在线字体排印资源。</p>\n<p>成为一名优秀的字体排印师并不难，难的是揭开字体排印这门艺术与科学本身的神秘面纱。Google Fonts Knowledge 的目标就是让所有人都能掌握这些技能。</p>\n<p>&lt;mio-image index=0&gt;&lt;/mio-image&gt;</p>","image":[{"a11y_description":"Google Fonts Knowledge homepage screenshot","bordered":true,"caption":null,"case":null,"file":{"file_path":"_f68a99ffe9144467a917320028f1ce3b_/_f3e8a4f639ce4c5aafa231fcb8daa630_/ebbcec4cbf00dd5bc25cb5032f3d8d103de551063e533c3780e368e5ead80ef1872517f042fd32f9bd96aa62478dd62497120f97e6bc30c1c4dd5847002a488f","height":3062,"url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pHf_iayB9z42wCMXL-SyuF4Gz6SjOByjWSrrwwrnhFbO5DQCBdhmNFNWW184q8KAzMtedGaznlfGrbf8bXGMcwobucX3GhGF_ZXzfCsbOsUEkPcdzFcf","width":2840}}],"related_links":[],"table":[],"video":[]}],"category":"2021","hero":{"a11y_description":null,"bordered":true,"caption":null,"case":null,"file":{"file_path":"_f68a99ffe9144467a917320028f1ce3b_/_f3e8a4f639ce4c5aafa231fcb8daa630_/6195da2705b3e29881cf492702faf08b237d8469d0230e6e12156e797b786bd6648afe0643b88f17270c89617cbaf04daf70b9d9d7ab70d37fd3bf1c358ea1cf","height":1800,"url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/7I_HJpE7Ey92aJnE6PLYwwPVR4DEnPScLc7zAR3fUsVDQYWQgYrlrk7UOKEDj6rfreKBVWcgsT-N2viMuIedK7iaaBz-2_yyQvQ2ewfgTcC0DwO4DPI","width":2840}},"hero_card":false,"metadata":{"keywords":null,"meta_robots":null,"schema_structure":"{}","share_description":"了解 Google Fonts，提升你的网站设计。一项帮助设计师和开发者有目的地选择与使用字体的新资源。","share_image":{"file_path":"_f68a99ffe9144467a917320028f1ce3b_/_f3e8a4f639ce4c5aafa231fcb8daa630_/a8769953ea0905693fc3c1f8cc790b1a69a765fe89acb68d66764ba65230304fdc2c682b91490ab5d2ee5699160bfb82f109f147fddaa6e73e2ab080f4539864","height":1800,"url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/Ig3yR5V1QeB2zoprjEWiPQNuz9pajkDmGEXoOYkRYe4STWY-be_V_awX3tFB8-VMjJfhYwSlcoFrP6t6kbiSY7F_RpdtVaF3Pst8eSvPvRu9S8hRWZTK","width":2840},"share_title":"Announcing Google Fonts Knowledge - Material Design 3"},"published_date":"2021-12-07T10:00:00","slug":"google-fonts-knowledge","subtitle":"一项帮助设计师和开发者有目的地选择与使用字体的新资源","title":"Google Fonts Knowledge 正式发布","